# {{PROJECT_NAME}}

A Soroban timelock contract scaffolded by [Sorobix](https://github.com/Soro-Bix/soroban-scaffold).

## Template: Timelock

- `initialize(admin)`
- `schedule(to, amount, release_time)` — admin schedules a transfer, returns id
- `release_time(id)` / `is_executed(id)`
- `execute(id)` — only after `release_time` has passed

## Build

```bash
cargo build --target wasm32-unknown-unknown --release
cargo test
```
